flowchart LR
  Browser[React UI] -->|Same origin HTTPS| Edge[TLS reverse proxy]
  Edge -->|Trusted loopback| API[Express API]
  API --> Auth[Session and role guards]
  API --> CSRF[CSRF and input validation]
  API --> Limits[Per-user limits and admission]
  Limits --> Worker[Bounded inspection worker]
  Worker --> Extractor[Bounded extraction worker and format strategies]
  Extractor --> Snapshot[Raw text fields and provenance snapshot]
  Snapshot --> Atlas
  API --> Rules[ValidationEngine]
  API --> Compare[DocumentComparisonService]
  Compare --> Sources[Account-anchored reference and aligned extraction]
  Sources --> Atlas
  Compare --> Freshness[Source fingerprint and manual review gate]
  Freshness --> Rules
  API -->|TLS| Atlas[(MongoDB Atlas)]
  API --> Private[(Private files and SHA-256)]
